"configure :setting:`GOOGLE_CLOUD_ERROR_REPORTING` in :file:`settings.py`:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Weblate automatically reports errors under the ``weblate`` service and uses "
"the current Weblate version or Git revision as the reported version. These "
"values can be overridden by setting ``service`` or ``version`` "
