#| "Below the translation, translators will find suggestion made by others, "
#| "to be accepted (✓), accepted with changes (✏️), or deleted (🗑)."
msgid ""
"Below the translation, translators will find suggestions made by others, to "
"be accepted (✓), accepted with changes (✏️), bulk accepted for a specific "
"user (👤✓), cloned into the translation fields (📑) or deleted (🗑)."
msgstr ""
"A fordítás alatt megjelennek mások által tett javaslatok, amelyek "
"elfogadhatók (✓), elfogadhatók módosítással (✏️) vagy törölhetők (🗑)."

#, fuzzy
